Constructor_Escrow_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the owner Safe or the payee Safe or the token is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the payments contract or the bootstrap owner is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the amount is 0
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAmount
├── when the job nonce is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroJobNonce
├── when the document hash is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroDocumentHash
├── when the condition is above 1
│   └── it should revert with InvalidCondition
└── when the terms are valid
    ├── it should store every term as an immutable
    ├── it should compute the payment id from Payments for the fixed item
    ├── given the condition is payee claimed
    │   └── it should make the escrow the payment's executor
    ├── given the condition is invoice amount reached
    │   └── it should leave the executor empty
    └── it should emit EscrowCreated
